    "Database" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each event arrives as one line of JSON. Tidemark reads the process, its parent, host, remote IP, policy and rule, then writes the row. If the stream drops, it reconnects and carries on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个事件是一行 JSON。Tidemark 读取进程、父进程、主机、远端 IP、策略和规则，然后写入一行。订阅断开时会自动重连。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every %lld rows or %@ s, whichever comes first" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每 %lld 行或每 %@ 秒写一次，先到为准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every row is tagged with the Mac it came from, so several Macs can share one database. Each Mac records and alerts on its own apps. Use the Mac menu at the top of the sidebar to look at one Mac's data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行都会标明来自哪台 Mac，所以几台 Mac 可以共用一个数据库。每台 Mac 只记录和提醒自己的 App，用侧边栏顶部的 Mac 下拉菜单切换，就能只看某一台的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows System Settings › Appearance until you move it here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认跟随系统设置 › 外观，在这里拖动后只对 Tidemark 生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
